OL,3,GNEWSAParking tickets sent to patient in
OL,4,Aintensive care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been issued three parking
OL,7,Ftickets and sent a letter from a debt
OL,8,Fcollection company while she was
OL,9,F"fighting for her life" in hospital.
OL,11,FDavid Matthews, from Elloughton, East
OL,12,FYorkshire, said his daughter, Kate, 36,
OL,13,Fhad been receiving treatment at Hull
OL,14,FRoyal Infirmary since March and had
OL,15,Fspent time in intensive care.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
