OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParking tickets sent to patient in
OL,4,Aintensive care
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid said he had been paying for
OL,7,Fweekly parking permits for his
OL,8,Fdaughter's car but had still received
OL,9,Fthe parking charge notices (PCNs). He
OL,10,Fadded he had tried to contact parking
OL,11,Fcompany APCOA but was told they would
OL,12,Fspeak only to the registered owner of
OL,13,Fthe vehicle.
OL,15,FThe NHS Humber Health Partnership and
OL,16,FAPCOA have apologised and have
OL,17,Fcancelled the charges.
